      "definitions": [
        {
          "content": "Vehicles having a known conventional true value (T.1.9) of:"
        },
        {
          "content": "- mass, and single-axle load of a two-axle rigid vehicle; and"
        },
        {
          "content": "- mass of other vehicles used for in-motion tests (6.5),"
        },
        {
          "content": "determined on a control instrument (T.1.8)."
